 "content": [
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 2
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "1. Description"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "On the Work In Progress report, the "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Asset",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " filter does not offer every asset that is on the report. Where two different vehicles happen to share the same unit number, the filter lists only one of them \u2014 and it shows that one's vehicle identification number against the shared unit number. The other vehicle is simply not in the list, so typing its vehicle identification number brings up nothing at all."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "The filter is meant to let you type either the unit number or the vehicle identification number. For these vehicles the second half of that promise does not work, and a service manager searching for a truck by the number on its windscreen concludes the truck has no open work, when in fact it has."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "On today's test data six vehicles are affected across five shared unit numbers. The clearest one belongs to customer "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Euwood Paving",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": ", which has two different trucks both numbered "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "854",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Why it matters quietly rather than loudly: the filter looks like it is working. You type a unit number, you get a result, and nothing tells you that a second vehicle with that same number exists and has been left out."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
